  "prefLabel": "Par 212.02 Contents of Explanation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 212.02 Contents of Explanation. The board shall, within 90 days of receiving a request in accordance with Par 212.01, provide a written response which:\n\n(a) Concisely states the meaning of the rule adopted.\n\n(b) Concisely states the principal reasons for and against the adoption of the rule in its final form; and\n\n(c) States, if the board did so, why the board overruled any arguments and considerations presented against the rule.\n\nSource. #12157, eff 4-7-17 (formerly Par 213.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/par100-500.html"
